<title>ZIMBABWE: TENNIS-ZIMBABWE LEAD UKRAINE 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ZIMBABWE LEAD UKRAINE 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1997-02-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe took a 2-0 lead over</p>
<p>Ukraine in their Davis Cup Euro/African zone group one first</p>
<p>round tie after winning the opening singles.</p>
<p>Results (Zimbabwe names first, played Friday):</p>
<p>Byron Black beat Andrei Rybalko 6-2 7-6 (5-7) 6-3</p>
<p>Wayne Black beat Andrei Medvedev 6-4 6-3 6-7 (4-6) 6-4</p>
</text>
